{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"b2f4fa6172b7d1a0c6bab5f9806910896d247f986a35a93a6d53138fcf575926":{"role":"assistant","text":"I'll begin the mine-and-sell loop as requested. Let me start by checking my current status and then proceed with the steps.\n\n<function=game>\n<parameter=command>\nget_status\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>"},"6a42c771961361de5ee8a089214d81e27290a3821f3ac83b0aa65e2408b31242":{"role":"user","text":"Continue your mission."},"6712f8db908103ab2dd7a13e31a26ca4dec197be482f9a014412dc80c2e4e985":{"role":"assistant","text":"I need to check my current location and status before proceeding with the mission.\n\n<function=game>\n<parameter=command>\nget_location\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>"},"eb02050508020789b339450ef75f7f102ce62665c424c3a4ee455ee33beae2e3":{"role":"assistant","text":"I need to get my current location to verify I'm at Benchmark Home Station as required.\n\n<function=game>\n<parameter=command>\nget_location\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>"},"e0319fde6bec12e52d